    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d35-a5">

                <pb facs="0136" n="48" xml:id="pg48"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Subenclosure 4—Translation]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The German Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Romberg</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the President
                        of the Swiss Federal Council</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Calonder</hi>)</head>
                <p rendition="#flush">A. I. 19576</p>
                <p>The undersigned German Minister in conformity to instructions received has the
                    honor to respectfully request the Swiss Government to communicate the following
                    telegraphically to the Government of the United States of America: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>According to telegraphic news Mr. Hoover is on his way to Europe. The
                            German Government requests the American Government to empower Mr. Hoover
                            with the organizing of the import of food stuffs into Germany. German
                            experts would be placed at his service for his information at the
                            Hague.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>The undersigned takes this opportunity to renew to His Excellency the President
                    of the Republic the assurances of his distinguished consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Romberg</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
